              "$type": "ShaderFX",
              "$id": "fx2",
              "active": true,
              "code": "// @whimtex-effect Learn/Steam Density\r\n// @param point _Center = (0.5, 0.5)\r\n// @param float2 _Radius = (0.36, 0.4)\r\n// @param float _Density = 1.2 [0 .. 3]\r\n// @param float _Breakup = 0.45 [0 .. 1]\r\n// @param float _Contrast = 1.15 [0.25 .. 3]\r\n// @param float _EdgeSoftness = 0.8 [0.1 .. 1]\r\n// Input is native procedural noise; output is tint-ready vapor density.\r\nfloat4 ApplyFX(float2 uv, float4 color) {\r\n float n=saturate(color.r);\r\n float nx=SampleInput(saturate(uv+float2(.153,.219))).r;\r\n float ny=SampleInput(saturate(uv+float2(-.241,.137))).r;\r\n float2 p=(LayerToLocal(uv)-_Center)/max(abs(_Radius),.001);\r\n p+=(float2(nx,ny)-.5)*_Breakup*1.5;\r\n float r=length(p);\r\n float envelope=exp(-r*r*1.1)*(1-smoothstep(1-_EdgeSoftness*.55,1.35,r));\r\n float density=pow(smoothstep(.2,.78,n),_Contrast);\r\n float frame=smoothstep(0,.07,min(min(uv.x,1-uv.x),min(uv.y,1-uv.y)));\r\n return float4(1,1,1,saturate(density*envelope*_Density*frame));\r\n}\r\n",
